      "prompt": "You are driving out of a driveway to turn right onto the main road, and a car is coming on the main road. Who goes first? Tap the car.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "road-car",
          "label": "the car on the main road"
        },
        {
          "id": "you",
          "label": "your car"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "road-car",
      "then": {
        "highlight": "road-car",
        "say": "The car on the main road goes first. You are entering the road, so you wait and let it pass."
      },
      "rule": "When you enter a main road from a driveway, an alley, a parking lot or the roadside, you yield to all vehicles already on the main road."
    },
