      "answer": "you",
      "then": {
        "say": "Your car waits, and both cars on the main road go first. Your road ends at the main road, so you let the traffic from both directions pass before you go."
      },
      "rule": "At a T intersection, the vehicles on the road that ends yield to the traffic from both directions on the main road."
